thology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  18 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 08 13     FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Left  block G   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 15 33 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue  are two gray pink lymph nodes and one possible lymph node ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 7cm in greatest dimension  The nodes have minimal attached tan yellow adipose tissue  The smallest is inked black  and the two larger are serially sectioned  The two smallest are entirely submitted as A and the largest as B  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast lump  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 4cm portion of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with a short black stitch designating the superior and a long black stitch the lateral margins  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior blue  the superior green and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm indurated  well defined gray white mass which comes to 0 4cm of the superior  0 5cm of the posterior  0 6cm of