vity comes to 0 2cm of the inked margin  Also noted approximately 1 2cm from the cavity is a well defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan pink nodule which abuts the margin  The remaining cut surface shows diffuse dense gray white fibrous tissue with cystic change  Representative sections are submitted from one end to the alternate end as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the tissue adjacent to the tip of the localization as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the nodule as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  Karen Perrin  REMOVED_DATE and right breast final shaved margin medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of gray white to tan pink fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  Karen Perrin  REMOVED_DATE and right breast final shaved margin lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of tan pink fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  Karen Perrin  REMOVED_DATE and right breast final shaved margin cephalad   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of gray to tan pink tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal dense  cystic gray white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  Karen Perrin  REMOVED_DATE and right breast final shaved margin caudad   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of gray to tan pink fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  Sectioning reveals focal dense gray white fibrous tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  Karen Perrin  REMOVED_DATE and right breast final shaved margin posterior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REM