s located 1 4cm from the superior margin  1 3cm from the medial margin  1 8cm from the inferior margin  3 3cm from the lateral margin  2 8cm from the anterior tip  and 4 5cm from the posterior tip  No masses are identified  The remainder of the specimen consists of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior tip  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior tip  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue anterior to clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue immediately anterior to clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Area where clip was identified  including clip in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous tissue immediately posterior to clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibroadipose tissue away from the area of fibrous tissue  from the posterior region of the specimen  Received in formalin  labeled  left breast final margin superior   are 3 unoriented fragments of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm  which are serially sectioned to reveal no focal lesions or abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  left breast final margin inferior   are 4 unoriented fragments of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  which are serially sectioned to reveal no focal lesions or abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  left breast final margin medial   are 2 unoriented fragments of fibroadipose tissue  aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  which are serially sectioned to reveal no focal lesions or abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  left breast final margin lateral   are 3 unoriented fr