ed in Cassettes H K  Gross Description by  BONNET EYMARD MARC Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  1  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL   POSITIVE FOR CARCINOMA  GROSS DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   MASS GROSSLY CONSISTENT WITH CARCINOMA  MARGINS GROSSLY FREE OF TUMOR  O R  Resident  JOHN BISSONNETTE  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION , Unchecked.
