st lymph node is serially sectioned and submitted in P R  The half of lymph node that was taken from the frozen lab is submitted in S  Resident  JOHN BISSONNETTE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
