g in largest dimension from REMOVED_DATE to 1 5cm  The larger ones have whitish tan solid cut surface  Representative half of each lymph node is submitted in T and U  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST LEFT LATERAL  BIOPSY  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  BREAST LEFT SUPERIOR   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA    TUBULAR CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Suzanne B  Keel  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST MASS  2 SPECIMENS  LEFT  PART B  AXILLARY CONTENTS  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
