ch includes a REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm skin ellipse  A roentgenogram accompanies the specimen  Inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm ill defined stellate tan firm mass which lies within 0 5cm of the closest inked resection margin  Section frozen as FX 1  resubmitted in A  Portions of mass in B through D with sections of remainder in E through J  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
